# Testimony Of Glory (Q220), the orcs: a level 38 Orc Raider at cond 6 holding 19 timak heads and 19 tamlin skulls kills a Timak orc and a Tamlin orc, which completes both and
# sets cond 7, relogs, hands them in to Chianta for the scepter box, and takes it to Tanapi, who orders the Revenant of Tantos killed (cond 9); Kakai says to wait. Every script roll is pinned to 1.
